          "id": "missed_you_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "え。そういうの、急に言うと……反応に困る。",
          "displayText": "Eh. When you say that suddenly, I have trouble reacting.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "missed_you_001_02",
          "presentation": {
