          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "missed_you_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "でも、嫌じゃない。ちゃんと、少しうれしい。",
          "displayText": "But I do not dislike it. I am properly, a little happy.",
